; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">經濟部統計處<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">24</span>日公布工業生產指數，其中製造業生產指數<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">116.35</span>，年增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2.64%</span>，是歷年同月新高。（中央社檔案照片）</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">（中央社記者梁珮綺台北<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">24</span>日電）半導體產業持續點火，帶動工業生產動能，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">7</span>月工業生產指數年增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2.65%</span>，連續第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6</span>個月正成長，其中，製造業生產指數<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">116.35</span>，年增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2.64%</span>，是歷年同月新高。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">經濟部統計處今天公布工業生產指數<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">116.70</span>，年增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2.65%</span>，為歷年單月第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>高，其中，製造業生產指數<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">116.35</span>，年增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2.64%</span>，是歷年同月新高，兩者也是連續第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6</span>個月正成長。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">統計處副處長黃偉傑分析，電子零組件業指數為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">132.80</span>，為歷年單月第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>高，年增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">14.42%</span>，也是連續第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8</span>個月二位數成長，也是推升製造業成長主力，其中，積體電路業受惠<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5G</span>通訊、高效能運算、物聯網等應用持續推展，加上遠距商機帶動晶圓代工生產，年增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">22.01%</span>，創歷年同月新高，也是連續第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">9</span>個月正成長。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">而液晶面板及組建業年增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">7.07%</span>，主因電視品牌廠拉貨動能回溫、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">IT</span>面板需求暢旺、彩色濾光片、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">LCD</span>用玻璃基板連帶增產所致。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">黃偉傑說，遠距需求發酵，激勵伺服器、筆電生產暢旺，加上網通設備在國內產能擴增，電腦電子產品及光學製品業年增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">12.80%</span>，創歷年單月新高，也是連續第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6</span>個月正成長。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">傳統產業中，機械業因半導體生產設備受惠大廠產能擴增，減幅收斂，年減<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3.49%</span>。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">不過，其他傳產如石油及煤製品業、紡織業、基本金屬業、金屬製品業及化學原材料業受疫情影響，市場需求仍相當疲弱，加上部分產業進行維修，分別年減<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">26.52%</span>、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">22.10%</span>、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">14.03%</span>、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5.94%</span>及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1.75%</span>。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">展望未來，黃偉傑認為，隨著各品牌行動裝置新品接續上市，加上<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5G</span>通訊、高效能運算、物聯網等需求強勁，可望挹注資訊及電子產業生產動能，然而，疫情及美中貿易戰加深國際經濟不確定性，加上國內烯烴廠及鋼鐵大廠高爐歲修，恐抑制傳產生產表現。（編輯：林興盟）<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1090824</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">: https://www.cna.com.tw/news/firstnews/202008240228.aspx</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-08-25","clk_count":"106"}},"__N_SSG":true}